Cross-View Fusion

This package was reconstructed from an earlier CCVPE-based research backup and
the method described in "Fusing Satellite Imagery and Planimetric Maps for
Cross-View Localization" (Quang Long Ho Ngo, Zimin Xia, Alexandre Alahi, 2026).

The release retains the GNU General Public License version 3 supplied in
CCVPE/LICENSE in that backup. The LICENSE file is preserved verbatim. New package
code and modifications are distributed under GPL-3.0-only. This does not relicense
the paper or external projects.

Research lineage and acknowledgments:
- CCVPE: Zimin Xia, Olaf Booij, Julian F. P. Kooij.
  https://arxiv.org/abs/2303.05915
- Deformable DETR: deformable attention methodology.
  https://arxiv.org/abs/2010.04159
- OpenMMLab MMCV: the attention operator used by the backup; its public source
  was consulted for sampling conventions and initialization. No MMCV source file
  or compiled extension is bundled.
  https://github.com/open-mmlab/mmcv
- Facebook Research DETR: the backup's positional-encoding file attributes
  Facebook, Inc. and its affiliates, and modifications by Bowen Cheng. The
  release uses newly written cell-centered sine-encoding code.
  https://github.com/facebookresearch/detr

The package contains newly structured fusion code, not the original CCVPE model,
EfficientNet, OrienterNet/maploc, MultiMAE, or dataset implementations. Changes
and reconstruction decisions are recorded in docs/implementation.md.
